  "explicit_limitations": [
    "Small canonical suite (13 tasks, 122 checks): all 31 primary silent failures occur in T1/T2 (19/31 in t2-lbracket and counterbored plate; 0 in T4); lacks multi-solid assemblies, interference checks, and manufacturability/DFM validation.",
    "One task specification (t2-lbracket) admits two readings of the 40 mm base depth vs. 8 mm vertical wall (40 mm overall vs. 48 mm outboard), contributing 13/31 silent failures and 10/14 expert-vs-grader disagreements; excluding it lowers absolute rates (11.1% SS vs. 1.4% TU, McNemar p = 0.0005) without altering the architectural contrast.",
    "Primary population covers June 2026 snapshots of four models (no OpenAI/Google model in primary stats; incomplete 64-attempt gpt-5.5 exploratory run excluded) at 3 uncontrolled provider-default repetitions; sonnet and qwen legacy ablation arms ran 3 months later in September 2026 (sonnet via OpenRouter).",
    "Blind expert scoring of 81 stratified parts was conducted by a single co-author (Aravind Reddy G); unmodelled geometric properties bound silent-failure rates from below while grader false negatives bound them from above (3/18 outside t2-lbracket overturned).",
    "Tolerance bands are model-correctness bands rather than ISO IT6-7 functional fit tolerances, tool-use increases mean input tokens from 211 to 2,821, and human oversight in MBD/direct-to-CAM review remains untested."
  ],
